WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.020
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:09.460
Today I am going to explain a German Sci-fi
film called “Hidden reserves.”

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:11.160
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:17.210
Watch out and take care!

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:23.079
In the near future, a dystopian society comes
into existence in Vienna, Austria.

00:00:23.079 --> 00:00:28.730
Eighty-two percent of the Viennese population
live below the poverty line and for only one

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:33.470
percent of the population, prosperity and
wealth continues to rise.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:38.260
Since more than two third of the population
is under serious debt with no sources to pay

00:00:38.260 --> 00:00:41.910
it, an insurance company creates a new system.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:48.300
After death, the indebted citizens are reanimated
and kept in an artificial twilight state.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:53.809
Their lifeless body is used for several purposes
as a compensation of the debt they had collected

00:00:53.809 --> 00:00:55.440
throughout their life.

00:00:55.440 --> 00:01:00.629
The dead bodies’ mental and physical resources
are used for purposes like to store spare

00:01:00.629 --> 00:01:05.090
human body parts or to use their brains to
store information.

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:08.830
Most young women’s corpses are often used
as birthing machines.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:14.270
Only the people who have death insurance can
avoid the fate of being used even after death.

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:19.300
However, the insurance is so expensive that
only a few wealthy people can afford it.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:22.790
The protagonist of the movie is a man named
Vincent Baumann.

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:26.390
He is an insurance agent at the death insurance
field sales.

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:31.290
Vincent is one of the wealthy people who convinces
the other wealthy ones to get death insurance

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:32.610
from their company.

00:01:32.610 --> 00:01:36.910
In the beginning of the movie, he drives to
work for an important meeting with a potential

00:01:36.910 --> 00:01:38.050
client.

00:01:38.050 --> 00:01:42.390
Somewhere else in the city, an old woman dies
but her family doesn’t want to hand her

00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:44.170
body to the debt collectors.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:49.600
Hence, they put her in a vacuumed plastic
body bag to ship her somewhere else.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:54.350
However, their plan fails when someone informs
the soldiers about the dead woman and they

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:56.480
are arrested for their deeds.

00:01:56.480 --> 00:02:00.840
They bring the woman’s body out of the bag
and quickly start the resurrection process

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:04.470
to keep her body in a vegetative state for
future use.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:09.060
Back in the insurance company, Vincent practises
persuading the client before the meeting.

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:13.500
He plans to show the client the video of a
woman being recruited, alongside the video

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:18.100
of a normal funeral that will be provided
to the people with death insurance.

00:02:18.100 --> 00:02:22.440
According to him, the side by side comparison
will definitely get him a deal.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:27.880
Somewhere else, a girl named Lisa Sokulowa
wears a blonde wig and disguises herself as

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.020
someone else.

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:33.770
She is an activist who works against the current
debt collecting system along with her fellow

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:37.670
activists who have formed a group called the
parallel society.

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:42.350
Their main aim is to turn off the life support
camps where the reserved dead bodies are kept

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:43.550
with an attack.

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:46.780
But they still have a long way to go to achieve
their goal.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:51.100
The men who got arrested yesterday for trying
to conduct the old woman’s funeral are also

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.650
members of their group.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:57.870
Lisa and her associate Frei discuss the way
to get them out of imprisonment so they wouldn’t

00:02:57.870 --> 00:03:00.160
tell the police about their organisation.

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:05.190
Frei claims that there is no way to retrieve
them without a proper ID that they do not

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:06.190
own.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:10.970
But Lisa has connections she can talk to and
arrange the IDs in a day.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:15.680
At night, she goes to a party to meet her
source named Philip who hands her a level

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:17.890
two identification card.

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:22.190
Philip is also an insurance sales worker who
sells secret information for money.

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:26.720
Lisa demands a level three card because the
mission requires them to gain access to the

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.570
secret offices.

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:32.760
Philip hesitates, but agrees to get the card
in two days.

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:36.569
Vincent has a unique way of persuading potential
clients.

00:03:36.569 --> 00:03:41.300
He researches every aspect of their lives
before the meeting and uses them to convince

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:43.540
the clients.

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:51.330
This time, he has memorised an old lady’s
favourite song and her fears.

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:55.150
He is currently dancing with her on the said
song while telling her about the possible

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:57.980
risks if she doesn’t get death insurance.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:01.489
His plan works and he finals the deal.

00:04:01.489 --> 00:04:05.250
He meets his colleague Dietrich the next day
at work.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:09.360
The old lady was actually Dietrich’s client
who he couldn’t persuade.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:13.930
He asks Vincent to take yet another one of
his clients, Wladimir Sokulow, because he

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:16.049
is impossible to persuade.

00:04:16.049 --> 00:04:18.969
Wladimir Sokulow is Lisa’s wealthy father.

00:04:18.969 --> 00:04:23.379
Meanwhile, Lisa and the parallel community
are trying to figure out the ways they can

00:04:23.379 --> 00:04:27.599
attack the geriatric ward where all the dead
people are kept.

00:04:27.599 --> 00:04:32.190
They plan to destroy it and let the revived
dead bodies die in peace.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:38.090
Vincent’s boss Diana Dorn and the company
board interview him for a potential promotion.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:43.770
He is asked to make Lisa’s father Wladimir
get death insurance if he wants to be promoted.

00:04:43.770 --> 00:04:47.569
When he returns to work the next morning,
he notices that his friend Dietrich has been

00:04:47.569 --> 00:04:49.520
replaced with Philip.

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:53.800
Since Dietrich couldn’t make most sales,
it doesn’t surprise Vincent.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:58.699
At the club, Lisa and Frei wait for Philip
to arrive with the identification cards but

00:04:58.699 --> 00:05:00.180
he never does.

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:04.710
She goes to check in his house but it turns
out that after Philip was promoted, his old

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:07.589
apartment went to Dietrich and his wife.

00:05:07.589 --> 00:05:11.939
Lisa and Frei believe that Philip might have
sold them out to the insurance company.

00:05:11.939 --> 00:05:16.610
Lisa is relieved because she hadn’t told
Philip about their plan to attack the geriatric

00:05:16.610 --> 00:05:17.610
ward.

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:21.190
She sees Dietrich leaving his house and follows
him to the market.

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:25.669
He goes to the insurance company office and
transfers his death insurance to his unborn

00:05:25.669 --> 00:05:26.879
child.

00:05:26.879 --> 00:05:30.500
Following that, he walks to a bridge and commits
suicide.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:35.349
He has been troubled by the demotion at work
and couldn’t handle the pressure anymore.

00:05:35.349 --> 00:05:38.659
Lisa is beyond surprised at what she witnessed.

00:05:38.659 --> 00:05:42.490
After his death, Lisa’s father’s case
is transferred to Vincent.

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:47.039
Since he is a very important client, if Vincent
is unsuccessful in making the deal, he will

00:05:47.039 --> 00:05:50.270
be demoted to a mere field representative.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:54.479
Vincent takes on the challenge and gathers
all the information about Wladimir.

00:05:54.479 --> 00:05:59.469
Naturally, he also has to learn about Lisa
to approach her father with a good deal.

00:05:59.469 --> 00:06:03.719
He goes to meet Wladimir according to their
appointment and happens to bump into Lisa

00:06:03.719 --> 00:06:04.740
on the way.

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:08.039
The two share a brief conversation before
she leaves.

00:06:08.039 --> 00:06:12.030
Vincent knows that he has to go out of his
way to persuade Wladimir.

00:06:12.030 --> 00:06:16.449
He has found out that Wladimir transferred
his insurance to Lisa which she is unknown

00:06:16.449 --> 00:06:17.449
about.

00:06:17.449 --> 00:06:21.330
And since she is so against death insurance,
she will surely give it to someone else if

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:22.689
she finds out.

00:06:22.689 --> 00:06:26.139
Vincent blackmails Wladimir using this information.

00:06:26.139 --> 00:06:28.189
But the man doesn’t budge.

00:06:28.189 --> 00:06:31.499
Because of this Vincent loses his current
position in the job.

00:06:31.499 --> 00:06:36.240
Diana appoints him as a field representative
with his main aim to catch the activists who

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:38.849
are speaking against the insurance company.

00:06:38.849 --> 00:06:43.340
She also puts him on Lisa so that she can
persuade her father to take out a death insurance

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:44.340
policy.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:48.559
Vincent’s current apartment is taken away
and he has to move to the satellite and container

00:06:48.559 --> 00:06:51.050
districts that surround Vienna.

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:55.650
His new room is tiny and dusty, something
he is not used to.

00:06:55.650 --> 00:07:00.659
After researching Lisa's life, he finds out
she sings in a pub and goes to see her.

00:07:00.659 --> 00:07:04.439
They chat briefly after which, Lisa returns
to the changing room.

00:07:04.439 --> 00:07:09.770
To her surprise, one of her friends who had
been arrested, Chris, has escaped and returned

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:10.770
to them.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:14.930
He is heavily injured and won’t survive
without proper medical assistance.

00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:19.889
The next day, Vincent again returns to the
club claiming that he wants to hear her sing

00:07:19.889 --> 00:07:20.889
again.

00:07:20.889 --> 00:07:24.909
Frei says that Vincent is their only chance
to get a level three identification so Lisa

00:07:24.909 --> 00:07:27.479
will have to befriend him to acquire it.

00:07:27.479 --> 00:07:30.210
Later, Lisa follows him to his apartment.

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:34.129
She rents a room with a clear view of his
windows and spies on him.

00:07:34.129 --> 00:07:38.129
While she is at it, she calls him and asks
to go out on a date.

00:07:38.129 --> 00:07:42.479
Vincent is suspicious of the sudden proposal
but since he has to use her to get to her

00:07:42.479 --> 00:07:44.509
father, he accepts to go.

00:07:44.509 --> 00:07:48.759
To manipulate her, he reveals that her father
has transferred his insurance to her.

00:07:48.759 --> 00:07:52.990
The following day, Lisa meets Chris who is
on the verge of death.

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:56.169
He begs her to not let him go to the geriatric
ward.

00:07:56.169 --> 00:08:00.740
Lisa quickly rushes to the insurance company
and transfers her insurance to Chirs.

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:05.139
He dies shortly after but the police leave
him because of the insurance.

00:08:05.139 --> 00:08:09.840
The following day at work, Vincent is informed
that Lisa’s father Wladimir has been in

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:12.419
an accident and is heavily injured.

00:08:12.419 --> 00:08:16.729
It is clear to him that the accident was the
company’s plan to take over Wladimir’s

00:08:16.729 --> 00:08:17.729
wealth.

00:08:17.729 --> 00:08:19.819
But he has no basis to prove the claim.

00:08:19.819 --> 00:08:23.659
He quickly goes to meet Lisa who is devastated
by her father’s accident.

00:08:23.659 --> 00:08:27.930
He clarifies that he wasn’t the one behind
it but she doesn’t believe him.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:32.340
She doesn’t even get to see her father because,
without insurance, his body belongs to the

00:08:32.340 --> 00:08:33.340
company.

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:36.709
She is dedicated to getting him out of the
geriatric ward.

00:08:36.709 --> 00:08:39.800
At night, Vincent goes to meet her in her
apartment.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.579
They eventually kiss and make love.

00:08:42.579 --> 00:08:48.449
But when he is asleep, Lisa scans his wrist
and steals his third-level identification.

00:08:48.449 --> 00:08:52.930
Her main motto for spending the night with
him was to use him to get to the ward and

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:54.230
free her father.

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:58.810
The next day, the company and Vincent find
out that she was successful in getting him

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:00.540
out of the geriatric ward.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:06.350
Diana blames him for being careless but Vincent
had put a tracker in Lisa’s bike.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:11.230
Using it, the police find her father and bring
him back to the geriatric ward.

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:16.360
Lisa tries to save him but Vincent stops her,
claiming that they will arrest her if she

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:17.480
interferes.

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:20.360
The next day, he goes to the pub again.

00:09:20.360 --> 00:09:23.250
Lisa cannot help but tear up after seeing
him.

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:27.850
He claims that the insurance company used
him to get to her and that he had no connection

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.620
with her father’s accident.

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:33.829
He no longer wants to help the company and
is now on her side.

00:09:33.829 --> 00:09:38.550
She takes him to the life support camp where
they see bodies of people being taken inside

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.209
the geriatric ward.

00:09:40.209 --> 00:09:43.630
Vincent notices that one of the bodies is
Dietrich’s.

00:09:43.630 --> 00:09:47.920
He is disgusted that the company is profiting
from their employee's death.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:53.029
Lisa tells him that she needs a three-level
identification card to get to her father and

00:09:53.029 --> 00:09:54.250
bring him out.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:59.139
Vincent agrees to give her his card if she
promises that someone else will enter the

00:09:59.139 --> 00:10:04.069
ward to get her father because he doesn’t
want to put Lisa’s life in danger.

00:10:04.069 --> 00:10:08.680
Lisa then brings him to an abandoned water
park where she used to play as a kid.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:13.190
She reminisces about her childhood days and
claims that the park is her favorite place

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:14.889
in the entire world.

00:10:14.889 --> 00:10:18.790
That night, the two make love and share the
card’s information.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:23.740
The following day, Lisa disguises herself
as an employee from the insurance company,

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:27.300
planning to disobey Vincent and go to the
ward herself.

00:10:27.300 --> 00:10:32.720
She and the others from the parallel society
devise an elaborate plan to paralyze the geriatric

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:35.920
ward from the inside with an electromagnet.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:38.779
Lisa enters the establishment without any
trouble.

00:10:38.779 --> 00:10:41.709
Vincent finds out about this and follows her
behind.

00:10:41.709 --> 00:10:47.070
Everything goes according to the plan but
when Lisa is about to attack, Philip unexpectedly

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:48.139
stops her.

00:10:48.139 --> 00:10:53.320
It turns out that his job from the very beginning
was to find out about the parallel society’s

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:54.709
plan and stop it.

00:10:54.709 --> 00:10:57.490
Outside, Frei is also arrested.

00:10:57.490 --> 00:11:02.200
Lisa is brought to her father when Vincent
suddenly attacks the guard in an attempt to

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:03.200
help her.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:07.329
However, before she can escape, she is shot
by Philips.

00:11:07.329 --> 00:11:12.209
She limps towards a shocked Vincent and passes
away before his eyes.

00:11:12.209 --> 00:11:16.520
Philips raises his gun to shoot him as well
but stops.

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:20.470
When Vincent opens his eyes again, Diana is
in front of him.

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:26.000
She says that unknowingly Vincent helped them
with the job, so he is promoted again and

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:28.860
is allowed to move out of the satellite town.

00:11:28.860 --> 00:11:32.920
He then gets up and sneaks into the geriatric
ward to look for Lisa.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:38.160
He finds her with the surrogate mothers, where
she is artificially kept alive to be impregnated

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:39.329
later.

00:11:39.329 --> 00:11:43.300
He loosens her life-sustaining tubes and brings
her out of the ward.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.920
Diana sees this but doesn’t stop him.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:52.230
At last, he lets her drown in an old water
slide that she used to visit as a child.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:56.670
